  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voices for Climate Action AMwA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMwA as part of the VCA consortium envisions a dignified and equitable feminist society for African women, girls and gender-expansive persons. This will be achieved through building a feminist leadership and collective power to deconstruct intersectional systems of oppression to advance gender and social justice. The VCA programme is being implemented under one of our thematic areas; Economic Justice and climate action through partnerships in in 3 countries in Africa Tunisia, Kenya and Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
